type: software
title: "Ultratreiber (UDX)"
abstract: >-
  Research demonstrator of an isolated, read-only access broker with
  fail-closed request parsing, OS-credential-bound peer identity and
  evidence-gated Linux and Windows named-pipe lanes. Not production ready.
